	(text "2x Comchip CDBHM1100L-HF Schottky bridge (100 V / 1 A, MBS / TO-269AA) replaces 8x B1100.\nPins per KiCad TO-269AA (1,2 = ~, 3 = +, 4 = -): confirm +/- corner vs Comchip datasheet."
