	)
	(text "CMC Wurth 744223 WE-SL2 (2x500 uH, 1 A, 80 VDC, 9.2x6 mm). Murata EMC test used PE-53913NL (6 mH);\nvalidate conducted EMI, WE-SL2 family shares footprint for value swaps.\nD1 SMAJ58A sits at the module pins, after the CMC. Vbr min 64.4 V > MYBSP abs-max 60 V:\nit limits surge energy but cannot keep the module below 60 V. Port-side surge (GDT/shield) on RJ45 sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7ae22ed6-a061-4e3f-94b2-e7f2bd8dfe81")
	)
	(text "U8 TVS0701: +/-7 V standoff, 11 V clamp @ 30 A, same DRB footprint as the old TVS1401.\nFL1 ACM4520-231: 3.0 A @ 60 C (old -901 was 2.3 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "97d526c4-f5b7-4a00-ae2a-db50aed05864")
	)
	(text "+3V3: 5 V -> 3.3 V / 3 A, enabled by SOM SYS_PG."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "996d2ac4-e5ae-48fd-9a0d-1e6d86cb24c3")
	)
	(text "M4: NO capacitor between +VIN and -VIN (IEEE 802.3at inrush).\nModule has no OVP / no OTP -> output OVP done by the TPS2121 mux."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d9e34980-c575-44c7-956a-f8daa25bd77f")
	)
	(text "Adapter ORing (Murata typ. circuit): USB present -> U14 pulls DEN\nto -VIN -> MYBSP off. R21 680R, R22 3.3k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 109.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e25aa84d-d85d-47b8-ae08-522fe68a7839")
	)
	(text "TPS2121 mux: IN1 = USB_5V (priority, PR1 > 4.25 V), IN2 = PoE (VCCIN).\nOVP ~5.75 V on both inputs (44.2k/10k), ILIM 22.1k ~ 4.5 A, CP2 -> GND.\nST -> PWR_MUX_ST, R913 10k to 3V3: high = IN1 (USB), low = IN2 (PoE).\nReplaces Q1-Q4 discrete ideal diodes (DMG2305UX SOT-23 was under-rated for 5 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 93.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f1be1762-3ed8-4623-ab64-1e61e20d0ec3")
	)
